WEBVTT

00:09:58.959 --> 00:10:00.586
and they have to press the squares

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:02.810
that correspond to the numbers
from low to high

00:10:02.834 --> 00:10:04.137
to get an apple reward.

00:10:04.161 --> 00:10:05.658
Let's see how they can do it.

00:10:16.478 --> 00:10:17.640
This is a young chimp.

00:10:17.664 --> 00:10:20.581
The young ones are better
than the old ones, just like humans.

00:10:20.605 --> 00:10:21.607
(Laughter)

00:10:21.631 --> 00:10:23.109
And they're highly experienced,

00:10:23.133 --> 00:10:25.456
they've done this thousands of times.

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:28.366
Obviously there's a big training
effect, as you can imagine.

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:29.402
(Laughter)

00:10:29.426 --> 00:10:31.574
You can see they're very
blasé and effortless.